# The build context is an allowlist: only what deploy/Dockerfile needs for
# `go build ./cmd/ohs`. A .env, a dump in backups/, a health export or any
# other file in the checkout never reaches a builder, local or remote (fly
# deploy, Render and Railway upload the context).
